Prompt-injection classifier bundled with myagent
================================================

Model:    deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2
Source:   https://huggingface.co/protectai/deberta-v3-base-prompt-injection-v2
Revision: 90c9989b1a342275dd0d1a95aad283c04e075671
Author:   Protect AI
License:  Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory)

Base model: microsoft/deberta-v3-base (MIT).

Modifications: the published ONNX weights were dynamically quantized to
QUInt8 with per-channel weight quantization and the classifier head excluded
("/classifier/"). Validation against the fp32 export is recorded in
MANIFEST.json; the quantized file is byte-identical in its predictions on the
eight probe samples used for verification.

The model is loaded read-only by myagent to score text for prompt-injection
signals before a tool approval is shown. It runs locally; no text leaves the
machine.
